[
  {
    "name": "Midnight Harbor Creator and Community Network",
    "description": "Explore Seer Media's COMMUNITY_NETWORK property graph using Midnight Harbor creator and audience-session relationships.",
    "version": "7",
    "layout": "zeppelin",
    "type": "Default",
    "snapshot": false,
    "isEditable": true,
    "isRunnable": true,
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "",
          "**Midnight Harbor Creator and Community Network**",
          "",
          "Explore Seer Media's `COMMUNITY_NETWORK` property graph. The `entity` vertex label represents creator profiles, viewer sessions, devices, and other community evidence. The `related_to` edge label represents the observed relationship between them.",
          "",
          "Start from `CREATOR-MH-8841`, the Midnight Harbor focal creator profile. The first query follows one or two relationship hops and ranks the reached entities by their engagement-review priority. A priority score supports review; it does not prove coordinated community behavior."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}"
      },
      {
        "row": 1,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%sql",
          "SELECT DISTINCT entity_key, display_name, entity_type,",
          "       relationship_hops, risk_score, risk_level, event_count",
          "FROM GRAPH_TABLE ( community_network",
          "  MATCH (seed IS entity) -[e IS related_to]->{1,2} (reached IS entity)",
          "  WHERE seed.entity_key = 'CREATOR-MH-8841'",
          "  COLUMNS (",
          "    reached.entity_key AS entity_key,",
          "    reached.display_name AS display_name,",
          "    reached.entity_type AS entity_type,",
          "    COUNT(e.relationship_type) AS relationship_hops,",
          "    reached.risk_score AS risk_score,",
          "    reached.risk_level AS risk_level,",
          "    reached.event_count AS event_count",
          "  )",
          ")",
          "ORDER BY risk_score DESC, entity_key, relationship_hops",
          "FETCH FIRST 25 ROWS ONLY;"
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "table",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": false,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}"
      },
      {
        "row": 2,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "",
          "**Graph Visualization of Creator and Community Reach**",
          "",
          "Run the next query to draw one-hop and two-hop paths from `CREATOR-MH-8841`. `ONE ROW PER STEP` returns intermediate vertices and edges. `VERTEX_ID` and `EDGE_ID` let Graph Studio render graph elements rather than only scalar properties. An entity can be reached by more than one path."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}"
      },
      {
        "row": 3,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%sql",
          "SELECT *",
          "FROM GRAPH_TABLE (",
          "  community_network",
          "  MATCH (src IS entity)-[e IS related_to]->{1,2}(dst IS entity)",
          "  WHERE src.entity_key = 'CREATOR-MH-8841'",
          "  ONE ROW PER STEP (v1, e1, v2)",
          "  COLUMNS (",
          "    VERTEX_ID(src) AS seed_id,",
          "    VERTEX_ID(v1) AS v1_id,",
          "    EDGE_ID(e1) AS e1_id,",
          "    VERTEX_ID(v2) AS v2_id",
          "  )",
          ");"
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "visualization",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": false,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}"
      },
      {
        "row": 4,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "",
          "**Shared Device Connections**",
          "",
          "The next graph centers on `DEV-fp-91a7`, a launch-weekend device shared by the focal creator and viewer sessions. Inspect `RELATIONSHIP_TYPE`, `EVENT_COUNT`, and `TOTAL_AMOUNT` on an edge. A shared device is investigation evidence, not proof that accounts are controlled by the same person. Layout and node colors can vary between runs."
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}"
      },
      {
        "row": 5,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": null,
        "hasTitle": false,
        "message": [
          "%sql",
          "SELECT *",
          "FROM GRAPH_TABLE (",
          "  community_network",
          "  MATCH (device IS entity)-[e IS related_to]-(connected IS entity)",
          "  WHERE device.entity_key = 'DEV-fp-91a7'",
          "  COLUMNS (",
          "    VERTEX_ID(connected) AS connected_entity_id,",
          "    EDGE_ID(e) AS relationship_id,",
          "    VERTEX_ID(device) AS device_id",
          "  )",
          ");"
        ],
        "selectedVisualization": "visualization",
        "visualizationConfig": null,
        "hideCode": false,
